# firmware-only packages are pinned to the tested firmware image. In
# particular, Nikki/Mihomo install firewall defaults and require kmod contracts;
# AdGuardHome and Lucky include service lifecycle or architecture-specific
# binaries; CUPS updates require a matching library/filter closure; EasyTier
# requires kmod-tun and an architecture-specific release binary; Samba/CUPS
# need their matching library/filter closures; miniupnpd participates in the
# firewall/hotplug contract; HomeProxy and OAF depend on tested firewall/kmod
# contracts; PBR carries Taiyi-specific CMCC helpers.
firmware-only appfilter
firmware-only kmod-oaf
firmware-only luci-app-oaf
firmware-only luci-i18n-oaf-zh-cn
firmware-only open-app-filter
firmware-only luci-app-homeproxy
firmware-only luci-i18n-homeproxy-zh-cn
